'''Talent Unlock Stages''' are a group of [[Special Events|Special Stages]] that will grant access to the [[Talents]] of a [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] when completed. Currently, there are only Talent Unlock Stages for the [[Empire of Cats]] [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]].

